Rule 1 (tensor inputs should not be None)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= v_1 ≠ None ∧ v_2 ≠ None
>>
Rule 4 (tensor dtype should not be an integer type)
{v_1 : dtype} |= v_1 ≠ 1 ∧ v_1 ≠ 2 ∧ v_1 ≠ 3 ∧ v_1 ≠ 4 ∧ v_1 ≠ 5
>>
Rule 5 (tensor shape is valid for the operation)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
>>
Rule 9 (inputs should have the same shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1) = shape(v_2)
>>
Rule 14 (x1 and x2 should have a different value)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= v_1 ≠ v_2
>>
Rule 23 (x1 and x2 tensors must have a valid shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) > 0
>>
Rule 30 (tensor shapes should be broadcastable)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 33 (tensor shapes should be the same)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
